u  could still see parts of the things that  I did in my early college career and  like how it brought to this and then I  got introduced to people who were very  into illustration into 2d animation and  I got to collaborate with them to make  all these cool pieces and when I  graduated I was ready to conquer the  world and that actually leads me to the  next part of the story which is what  happened to me after Art Center all  right guys  sorry but there's a little bit of a  cliffhanger here I know I was gonna  share with you what happens after Art  Center but as you can tell this video is  already running along so we decided to  cut it into two parts and part two is  linked down below in that video we're  gonna cover my journey as a creative  professional going out in the real world  now owning my own business becoming a  freelancer and then working as a staff  creative director at blind so I hope to  share all of that with you in part 2  don't forget to watch that if you did  learn something from it let me know in  the comments below or share it with a  friend by sharing this video it really  helps us out as a channel to know that  you guys value and like this stuff and  that we should do more like this so  anything that I mentioned in this video  I'll be putting it in the links in the  description below and if you guys have  more questions about stuff I'll be  adding as many resources in there so  check their often don't forget to check  me out at Matthew in sina.com and at  Matthew and Cena on all the socials I'll  see you guys in the future  Oh

